@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
hide methods
top to bottom direction
title Professor profile — proposed model (not implemented)

  class ProfessorProfile <<entity>> {
    +id: UUID {PK}
    +userId: String {unique, required}
    +displayName: String {required, max 80}
    +degree: String {max 200}
    +department: String {max 120}
    +education: Text {max 2000}
    +about: Text {max 5000}
    +researchAreas: List<String>
    +contactEmail: String {optional, email}
    +virtualOfficeUrl: String {optional, HTTPS}
    +officeHours: String {max 500}
    +updatedAt: Instant
    +version: Integer {>= 1}
  }
  class ProfileImage <<value object>> {
    +storageKey: String {private object reference}
    +originalName: String
    +mediaType: String {PNG, JPEG, WebP}
    +sizeBytes: Integer {1..2097152}
  }
  ProfessorProfile "1" *-- "0..1" ProfileImage : photo
  class AuthenticatedUser <<external identity>> {
    +id: String
    +role: String {professor}
  }
  class PostedOpportunitySummary <<external read model>> {
    +id: String
    +professorUserId: String
    +title: String
    +description: String
    +department: String
    +areas: List<String>
    +posted: Date
    +deadline: Date
    +commitment: String
    +status: String {published}
  }
AuthenticatedUser "1" -- "0..1" ProfessorProfile : owns
AuthenticatedUser "1" -- "0..*" PostedOpportunitySummary : authored posts

note left of ProfessorProfile
  Proposal only: no database or ORM selected.
  Only the authenticated owner may edit.
  Update succeeds only if stored version matches.
  All attributes above belong to one profile aggregate.
end note
note bottom of PostedOpportunitySummary
  Read-only integration contract, not a new post table.
  Profile reads published posts by owner userId.
  Main's listings have no stable IDs or owner IDs.
  Post team must provide both before reliable filtering.
  Post creation/editing is outside this feature.
end note
@enduml
